{"id":"stockholm-tram-7-waldemarsudde","group":"stockholm-tram-7","city":"Stockholm","mode":"tram","line":"7","vehicle":"vagn","vehicleLong":"spårvagn","operator":"SL","api":"sl","tab":"Spårväg City","guide":null,"speedKmh":22,"dwellSec":15,"route":[[59.332038,18.062201],[59.332095,18.06215],[59.332487,18.063721],[59.332546,18.064322],[59.332335,18.065178],[59.332505,18.065746],[59.332775,18.071109],[59.333069,18.073802],[59.333087,18.075706],[59.332415,18.077644],[59.331388,18.081561],[59.331732,18.09267],[59.331652,18.093342],[59.331434,18.09372],[59.330097,18.094392],[59.328278,18.096504],[59.327861,18.096543],[59.326924,18.096048],[59.326578,18.096024],[59.325871,18.096419],[59.32507,18.097172],[59.324663,18.09775],[59.324336,18.098622],[59.324161,18.099449],[59.323396,18.103829],[59.323226,18.105293],[59.323111,18.107056],[59.323287,18.110206],[59.323206,18.110395],[59.322785,18.110622],[59.322644,18.111387]],"stops":[{"name":"T-Centralen","lat":59.332038,"lon":18.062201,"story":"Välkommen ombord på spårvagn 7 mot Waldemarsudde! Resan tar ungefär 12 minuter. Under gatorna klättrar blå rankor och blad över grottväggarna på blå linjens perronger. Konstnären Per Olof Ultvedt målade dem 1975, och bland slingorna syns silhuetter av arbetarna som byggde stationen. Ultvedt var annars mest känd för sina mekaniska skulpturer och var med och skapade den berömda installationen Hon – en katedral 1966.","tips":[],"dur":25.3,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Enkoping_%285721525533%29.jpg/1280px-Enkoping_%285721525533%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Hugh Llewelyn","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Enkoping_(5721525533).jpg","title":"Stockholm steam ferry \"Enkoping\" in the harbour, 6/10.","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Stockholm_%288273722196%29.jpg/1280px-Stockholm_%288273722196%29.jpg?