n från berg- och dalbanorna långt ut över vattnet. Mitt emot ligger konsthallen Liljevalchs.","tips":[["Gröna Lund","2 min"],["Liljevalchs konsthall","1 min"]],"dur":11.3,"images":[{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/Gr%C3%B6na_lund.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","credit":"Nord68","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gr%C3%B6na_lund.jpg","title":"Entrance of the amusement park Gröna lund in Stockholm.","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/SL_tram_line_SL_7_at_Liljevalchs.jpg/1280px-SL_tram_line_SL_7_at_Liljevalchs.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Leif Jørgensen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SL_tram_line_SL_7_at_Liljevalchs.jpg","title":"SL tram line 7 on Djurgårdsvägen at Liljevalchs/Gröna Lund in Stockholm.","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/ABBA_The_Museum_and_Pop_house_Hotel.jpg/1280px-ABBA_The_Museum_and_Pop_house_Hotel.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Leif Jørgensen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ABBA_The_Museum_and_Pop_house_Hotel.jpg","title":"ABBA The Museum and Pop house Hotel at Djurgårdsvägen in Stockholm.","near":true}],"audio":"audio/piper/90c33c5399a5703b.mp3"},{"name":"Skansen","lat":59.323749,"lon":18.101675,"story":"Skansen öppnade 1891 och är världens äldsta friluftsmuseum. Här finns gamla gårdar från hela Sverige, nordiska djur och en vid utsikt över Stockholm.","tips":[["Skansen","2 min"]],"dur":9.5,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Cirkus_January_2013_01.jpg/1280px-Cirkus_January_2013_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Arild Vågen","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cirkus_January_2013_01.jpg","title":"Cirkus is an arena in Djurgården, Stockholm, that holds 1,650 people. It was built in 1892 and origi","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Cirkus_January_2013_02.jpg/1280px-Cirkus_January_2013_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Arild Vågen","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cirkus_January_2013_02.jpg","title":"Cirkus is an arena in Djurgården, Stockholm, that holds 1,650 people. It was built in 1892 and origi","near":true},{"src":"https://ems.dimu.org/image/0231vy8LNFuS?dimension=600x600","credit":"Okänd","license":"CC BY","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/sk/photo/html/SKAFOT0000780-1","title":"Skansen","old":true,"year":1960,"museum":"Skansen"}],"audio":"audio/piper/a36654dc70541904.mp3"},{"name":"Djurgårdsskolan","lat":59.323238,"lon":18.104698,"story":"I trähuset i backen har Djurgårdsskolan funnits sedan 1878, och den är en av Stockholms äldsta skolor. Lite bort står Karl Johans-ekarna, där kungen enligt traditionen rastade på 1820-talet. På Slätten samlades förr ett brokigt folkliv, och enligt riksbibliotekarien Rydqvist kom Gustav III dit inkognito. Bellman ska ha suttit under en ek och improviserat visor till mandolinen.","tips":[["Se de gamla Karl Johans-ekarna","2 min"]],"dur":23.0,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Djurg%C3%A5rden_villa_2007.jpg/1280px-Djurg%C3%A5rden_villa_2007.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Djurg%C3%A5rden_villa_2007.jpg","title":"Djurgården villa 2007"},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Djurg%C3%A5rdssl%C3%A4tten_dec_2011x.jpg/1280px-Djurg%C3%A5rdssl%C3%A4tten_dec_2011x.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Djurg%C3%A5rdssl%C3%A4tten_dec_2011x.jpg","title":"Djurgårdsslätten dec 2011x"}],"audio":"audio/piper/e1163943dcc583bf.mp3"},{"name":"Waldemarsudde","lat":59.322644,"lon":18.111387,"story":"Snart är vi framme vid ändhållplatsen Waldemarsudde. Waldemarsudde var konstnären prins Eugens hem. Han var son till kung Oscar II och en av sin tids främsta landskapsmålare. I dag är hans villa och trädgård ett konstmuseum vid vattnet. Tack för att du åkte med!","tips":[["Prins Eugens Waldemarsudde","2 min"]],"dur":14.9,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Stockholm_Waldemarsudde_%2815299237023%29.jpg/1280px-Stockholm_Waldemarsudde_%2815299237023%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Tony Webster from Portland, Oregon, United States","license":"CC BY 2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stockholm_Waldemarsudde_(15299237023).jpg","title":"Stockholm, Sweden","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Oakhill%2C_2017z.jpg/1280px-Oakhill%2C_2017z.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Oakhill,_2017z.jpg","title":"Oakhill från sydväst","near":true},{"src":"https://pub.raa.se/dokumentation/e85fb814-7108-41b4-b43c-d09f78329541/visning/1","credit":"Curman, Carl","license":"Public domain","page":"https://kulturarvsdata.se/raa/dokumentation/html/e85fb814-7108-41b4-b43c-d09f78329541","title":"Kvarnen","old":true,"year":null,"museum":"Riksantikvarieämbetet"}],"audio":"audio/piper/76f42e9a42e26871.mp3"}],"looks":[{"id":"gronalund","lat":59.3233,"lon":18.0966,"r":260,"text":"Till höger ligger Gröna Lund, Sveriges äldsta nöjespark.","du